<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-,182-day T-bill yields fall, 91-day up.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-,182-day T-bill yields fall, 91-day up.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills fell to 22.54 percent on Tuesday from 23.89 percent at the last auction of 28-day paper on October 8, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>The annualised yield on 91-day T-bills rose to 30.19 percent from 29.73 percent on October 8.</p>
<p>The yield on 182-day paper fell to 34.01 percent, annualised, from 38.20 percent at auction on September 17.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>					     Oct 15	   Oct 8</p>
<p>    Issue volume			 6.00 million lei   3.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			1,000	    1,000</p>
<p>    Nominal demand		     10.55 million	12.83 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			  6.00 million	 3.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				  22.54 pct	23.89 pct</p>
<p>    Price				  98.3 pct	 98.2 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			97.7-98.6 pct  97.6-98.5 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity			     Nov 14, 1996   Nov 7, 1996</p>
<p>Full details of the 91-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>					     Oct 15	   Oct 8</p>
<p>    Issue volume			 10.00 million lei  10.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			1,000	    1,000</p>
<p>    Nominal demand		     8.58 million	 10.84 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			  8.58 million	 10.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				  30.19 pct	29.73 pct</p>
<p>    Price				  93.0 pct	 93.1 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			93.0-95.0 pct  93.0-94.0 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity			     Jan 16, 1997   Jan 9, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 182-day T-bill auction:</p>
