<p>    Nominal demand		     2.45 million	 1.91 million</p>
<p>    Volumne sold			 1.00 million	 1.90 million</p>
<p>    Yield				  34.01 pct	38.20 pct</p>
<p>    Price				  85.5 pct	 84.0 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			83.5-86.0 pct  83.0-86.0 pct</p>
